  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling Continuity of Evidence-Based Humanitarian Action Through DTM Data</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this project, the Displacement Tracking Matrix (DTM) global support team is providing gap-filling and funding support to DTM missions currently responding to ongoing or emerging crises. Additionally, support is being provided for essential technical services, guidance, and quality control to country level operations to reduce expertise burden in country operations; through surge support deployment and through remote consultation with country teams, with dedicated global staff ensure smooth running of the data pipeline from survey planning through analysis and dissemination. Equally important, the Global Support team is also supporting centralized information management, ensuring quality control, and harmonizing the application of DTM standards across missions in a way that having siloed staff in each country mission could never do alone.</narrative>
  </description>
